#tr.en: If (there is) a mole on the nape of (his neck) . . . 
3. _BE samag_ i-na zi-it-ti _gu2-husz lu2#_ [...] 
#tr.en: If (there is) a mole on the middle of the nape (of his neck), the man . . . 
4. _BE samag#_ i-na _sag-ki lu2_ sza _zag_ [...] 
#tr.en: If (there is) a mole on the forehead of a man . . . on the right . . . 
5. _BE [samag]_ i-na _sag-ki lu2_ sza2 _gub3_ [...] dan-na-[x ...] 
#tr.en: If (there is) a mole on the left side of a man’s forehead, he will be . . . by hardship. 
6. _BE# [samag]_ i-na# _sag#_ pu-ti-szu _gar_ i-na da-na-at i-s,a-ba-tu u2-ul#? [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his forehead, he will not be . . . by hardship, which will seize (him)  
7. _BE samag#_ [i]-na# szu-uh-ri-szu sza _zag gar_ sza uz-na-szu i-ba-asz-szi-a u2-x [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the right side of his eyebrow, he will not . . . what he has in mind. 
8. _BE samag_ i-na szu-uh-ri-szu sza 2(u)! _gar_ sza uz-na-szu i-ba-asz-szi-a qa2-as-su# [i-ka-asz-sza-ad] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the left side of his eyebrow, he will achieve what he has in mind.  
9. _BE samag_ i-na _ha-la_ szu-uh-ri-szu _gar_ sza u2-s,a-am-ma-ru i-na _mu 1(disz)-kam mu 2(disz)#-[kam_ i-ka-asz-sza-ad] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole at the mid-line of his eyebrows, he will achieve what he is pursuing within a year or two. 
10. _BE samag_ kap-pi2 i-ni-szu sza _zag gar dumu_-szu re-esz-tu-um i-na bi-tim [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his right eyelid, his first-born son will . . . in the house. 
11. _BE samag_ kap-pi2 i-ni-szu sza _gub3 gar dumu_-szu re-esz-tu-um i-sza-lim u3 i-[...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his left eyelid, his first-born son will be healthy and . . . 
12. _BE samag_ i-na sza-pa-al KIMIN!(U3) sza _zag gar dumu-mesz_-szu _{d}lamma_ u2-ul i-szu#-[u2 ...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole under the right side of DITTO, his sons will not have a protective deity. 
13. _BE samag_ i-na sza-pa-al KIMIN!(U3) sza _gub3 gar dumu-mesz_-szu i-lam i-szu-u2 u3 i-[...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole under the left side of DITTO, his sons will have a (personal) god and . . . 
14. _BE samag_ i-na ap-pi-i-szu _gar_ qa2-bi le-mu-tim ir-ta-na-ad#-[di-szu] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his nose, an utterance of evil will constantly chase after him. 
15. _BE samag_ i-na tu-bu-uq-qa2-at i-ni-szu sza _[zag] gar_ isz-di-ih-szu a-na be-el# [a-wa-tim i-sa3]-hu#-ur 
#tr.en: If there is a mole in the corner of his right eye, his profits will turn toward his legal adversary. 
16. _BE samag_ i-na tu-bu-uq-qa2-at i-ni-szu [sza _gub3] gar#_ nu-du-un-ni su2-qi2-im a-na# [x  x  x] isz-szar-ra-ak 
#tr.en: If there is a mole in the corner of his left eye, the wedding gift of the street (?) will be given to . . . as a gift. 
17. _BE samag_ i-na le-ti-szu sza _zag gar_ ba-ab-ta#-szu a-na le-mu-ut-tim iz-za-ka#-[ar]-szu# 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his right cheek, his merchandise will be disparaged, lit. will be mentioned for evil.  
18. _BE samag_ i-na le-ti-szu sza _gub3 gar_ e-li ba-ab-ti-szu i-na a-wa-a-tim [iz?-za?-az?] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his left cheek, his merchandise will be confirmed in court (?). 
19. _BE samag_ i-na sza-ap-la-an ap-pi-szu _gar mu_ li-it-ti-i i-na ma-as,-s,a-[x x x ib]-ba#-asz-szi 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the bottom of his nose, the name of (his) offspring will come into existence during the night watch. 
20. _BE samag_ i-na [u2-su-uk]-ki-szu sza _zag gar_ i-na _dumu-mesz_-szu isz-te-en la# [a]-wi#-[lu-tam it-ta-na-al-la-ak?] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his right cheekbone, one of his sons will constantly not act in a regal way. 
21. _BE samag_ i-[na u2-su-uk]-ki-szu sza _gub3 gar_ i-na _dumu-mesz_-szu isz-te-en a-wi-lu-[tam it-ta-na-al-la-ak?] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his left cheekbone, one of his sons will constantly act in a regal way. 
22. _BE samag#_ [i-na x x li]-sza-ni-szu i-na _zag gar lu2_ szu-a-ti i-na mi-qi2-it [pi-i is,-s,a-ba-at?] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the right side of his tongue, that man will be seized by an . . . 
23. [_BE samag_ i-na x x li]-sza#-ni-szu i-na _gub3 gar lu2_ szu-u2 mi-qi2#-it# [pi-i isz-sza-ra-ak-szu?] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the left side of his tongue, that man will be subjected to blasphemy. 
24. _BE samag#_ [i-na li?-sza?-ni?]-szu _gar_ tu-usz-szu i-na [mu-uh2-hi-szu i-ma-qu-ut?] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his tongue, slander will befall him. 
25. _BE samag_ i-[na x x li]-sza-ni-szu sza _zag gar_ i-na qa2-ti-szu#? 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the right side of his tongue, in his hand . . . 
26. _BE samag_ i-na [x x li]-sza-ni-szu sza _gub3 gar lu2_ szu-u2 it-[...] 
#tr.en: IF there is a mole on the left side of his tonuge, that man . . . . 
27. _BE samag_ i-na _ha-la_ [U3?] sza-ap-li-im _gar_ sza x-ti?-szu i-na x [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole in the middle of the tongue, . . . . 
28. _BE samag_ i-na su2-uq-ti-szu _zag gar_ lu-um-nu-um [...] i-na ni [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the right side of his chin, . . . bad . . .  
29. _BE samag_ i-na su2-uq-ti-szu sza _gub3 gar_ lu-um-nu-um a-na be-el [a-wa-ti-szu? ...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the left side of his chin, . . . bad for his legal adversary . . . 
30. _BE samag_ i-na _ha-la_ su2-uq-ti-szu _gar_ wa-sza-ab s,i-bi-[it-tim ...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole in the middle of his chin, living in a prison . . . 
31. _BE samag_ i-na ki-sza-di-szu# [sza] _zag gar_ ni-pi-ih i-sza-a-[tim ...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the right side of his neck, flaring of fires . . . 
32. [_BE samag_ i]-na# ki-sza-di#-[szu sza] _gub3 gar_ i-na ni-szu-ti-szu 1(disz) _lu2_ x [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the left side of his neck, there will be a man in his family . . . 
33. [... _lu2]_ szu-u2 a-di ba-al-t,u2 [...] 
#tr.en: . . .: that man, as long as he lives . . . 
34. [... x]-i id-da# [...] 
#tr.en: . . . 
