6. _BE samag_ i-na mu-uh2-hi# qa2#-ti-szu sza _zag gar_ i-na su-[x ...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the top of his right hand, . . . in . . . 
7. _BE samag_ i-na mu-uh2-hi# qa2#-ti-szu sza _gub3 gar_ i-na x [x] x x x [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the top of his left hand, . . . 
8. _BE samag_ i-na u2-ba-na#-[ti]-szu sza _zag gar_ a-na i-bi-us-si2-e u2-s,i-a-[am] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the fingers of his right hand, he will incur losses. 
9. _BE samag_ i-na u2-ba-na#-[ti]-szu sza _gub3 gar_ mi-im-mu-u2-szu [x x x] ma-ti-szu [x x] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the fingers of his left hand, his property . . . in his land . . . 
10. _BE samag_ i-na ap-pa-at [u2]-ba-na-ti-szu sza _zag gar_ mi-im-ma sza _ku3_ isz8-tar2 iz-za-x [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the tip of one of the fingers on his right hand, he will . . . whatever belongs to holy Ishtar. 
11. _BE samag_ i-na ap-pa-at u2-[ba]-na-ti-szu <sza> _gub3 gar_ ma-at i-ra-am-mu wa-ar-hi-isz [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the tip of one of the fingers on his left hand, a land that he loves . . . quickly. 
12. _BE samag_ i-na mu-uh2#-hi# u2-ri-szu _gar_ ni-szi li-ib-bi a-na asz-sza-ti-szu x [x x x] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole at the top of his genital region, sexual desire for his wife . . . 
13. _BE samag_ i-na <u2>-ri-szu _gar_ i-na hi-mi-it, li-ib-bi it-ta-na-ad-dar# 
#tr.en: If there is a mole in his genital region, he will be continually depressed due to anxiety. 
14. _BE samag_ i-na li-ib-bi i-sza-ri-szu _gar_ mu-tum mu-ur-s,um i-s,a-ba-as-su mu-tum x [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the middle of his penis, death and illness will seize him . . ., death . . . 
15. _BE samag_ i-na sza-pa-al i-sza-ri-szu _gar_ sza la i-du-u2 zi-ki-ir szu-mi-szu u2-sza-ba#-[lam] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the underside of his penis, someone he doesn't know will discuss the invocation of his name. 
16. _BE samag_ i-na isz-ki-szu sza _zag gar_ a-wa-at ib-ba-asz-szu-u2-szu u2-ul <i>-la-am-ma-ad 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his right testicle, he will not understand an (ominous) word that comes into existence for his benefit. 
17. _BE samag_ i-na isz-ki-szu sza _gub3 gar_ mi-qi2-it-ti be-el a-wa-ti-szu i-na _e2-gal_ 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his left testicle, the defeat of his legal opponent at the palace. 
18. _BE samag_ i-na sza-ap-ri-szu _gar_ a-wi-lum szu-u2 ir-ta-na-a-ad 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his thigh, that man constantly trembles. 
19. _BE samag_ i-na szu-bur-ri-szu _gar_ mi-qi2-it-ti _masz-ansze_ i-na _e2_-szu ib-ba-asz-szi 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his buttocks, an epidemic will occur among the animals in his house. 
20. _BE samag_ i-na pe-mi-szu sza _zag gar_ mi-im-mu-u2-szu dan-nu i-ik-ka-al-ma szu-u2 i-na-zi-iq 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his right upper thigh, a strongman will consume his fortune and he will be upset. 
21. _BE samag_ i-na pe-mi-szu sza _gub3 gar_ mi-im-ma-szu dan-na i-ik-ki-im-ma ni-s,i2-ir-tam la-bi-ir-tam i-[mar] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his left upper thigh, he will take away something of importance to him and he will discover an ancient treasure. 
22. _BE samag_ i-na ri-bi-ti-szu sza _zag gar_ ni-s,i-ir-ta-szu ka-ab-tu u3 _e2-gal_ i-mar 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his lower right hip, an important person or the palace will discover his treasure. 
23. _BE samag_ i-na ri-bi-ti-szu sza _gub3 gar e2-gal_ i-za-ak-ka-ar-szu ni-s,i-ir-tam i-ka-sza-ad u3 szum-szu iz-za-ak-ka-ar 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the lower left hip, the palace will praise him, he will find a treasure, and his name will be invoked. 
24. _BE samag_ i-na ba-ma-at pe-mi-szu sza _zag gar_ i-na szi-pi-ir i-di-szu szum-szu im-ma-as-si2-ik 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the . . . of his right upper thigh, his reputation will be tarnished through his actions. 
25. _BE samag i-na ba-ma-at pe-mi-szu sza _gub3 gar_ i-na szi-pi2-ir [i]-di#-szu i-sze-ir-ma i-na a-li-szu pi-szu i-te-el 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the . . . of his left upper thigh, he will get rich through his actions and his speech will be prized in his city. 
26. _BE samag_ i-na ki-im-s,i2-szu sza _zag# [gar]_ x x [x] x-zu i-bi-ir-ri ta-ra-as-su2 ka-bi-it 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his right shin, . . . he will be hungry, his . . . will be weighty. 
27. _BE samag_ i-na ki-im-s,i2-szu sza# [_gub3 gar_ x x x x] am sza isz-da-szu ki-na i-la-ak 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his left shin, . . . he will travel a . . . whose foundation is solid. 
28. _BE samag_ i-na sza-pa-al ki-im-s,i2#-szu# sza# _zag# gar_ mu-szi u3 ur-ri-im u2-i-a u3 a-i-a ra-ki-is#-[sum] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the bottom of his right shin, day and night sighs and murmurs will be bound to him. 
29. _BE samag_ i-na sza-pa-al ki-im-s,i2-szu _gub3 gar_ li-ib-ba el-s,a sza ma-di-isz la na-szi-<e> isz-sza#-[ak-ka-an] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the bottom of his left shin, he will be given such as joyous heart that he will not (be able to) bear it. 
30. _BE samag_ i-na sza-hu-ur szi-pi-szu sza# _zag# gar_ mi-si2-ir _e2-gal_ sza ni-zi-iq-ti i-si2-[ir-szu] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the . . . of his right foot, imprisoned by the palace, which will cause him distress. 
31. _[BE samag]_ i-na sza-hu-ur szi-pi-szu sza _gub3 gar_ mi-si2-ir _e2-gal_ sza za-ka-ar szu-mi-szu# [x x x] i-si2-ir szu-u2-ma szum-szu iz-za-ka-ar 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on the . . . of his left foot, imprisoned by the palace, which the invocation of his name . . ., he will invoke his own name. 
32. _BE samag_ i-na ki-s,a-al-li#-szu# sza# _zag# gar_ wa-szi-ib mah-ri-szu a-wa-ti-szu x [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his right ankle, the one who sits before him will . . . his words. 
33. _BE samag_ i-na ki-s,a-al-[li-szu sza] _gub3# gar#_ [x x x x]-ti be-el a-wa-ti#-[szu ...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his left ankle, . . . his legal adversary . . . . 
34. _BE samag_ i-na li-x [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on . . . . 
35. _[BE samag i]-na# [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on . . . . 
36. _[BE samag_ i]-na# [...] 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on . . . . 
37. _[BE samag_ i]-na# li-ib-bi _gesztu2_-szu sza _zag gar_ i-na ta-ag-gi4-ir-ti iz-za-ak-ka-ar szu-ma la dam#?-qa2 isz-<<asz>>-sza-ka-an 
#tr.en: If there is a mole inside his right ear, he will be mentioned with denunciation, he will get a bad reputation. 
38. [BE _samag_ i-na] li#-ib-bi _gesztu2_-szu sza _gub3 gar_ ta-ag-gi4-ir-tum i-na pi-szu i-me-a-ad 
#tr.en: If there is a mole inside his left ear, the denunciation from his own mouth will grow numerous. 
39. [...] x-ra-ni-szu _gar_ s,e-li-tum sa-ad-ra-a-szum 
#tr.en: If there is a mole on his . . ., . . . will regularly be to him. 
 
 

